=== 2026-09-05, re-scored on review of pull request 84 ===
Re-run of score.py against the same committed output/shares.json and
output/states_meta.json. No state was rebuilt and no decomposition was run: this
stage reads the committed share tables only. Three things were added to the
scoring and nothing was removed. First, the spread of the prolet attractor's
control shares is now computed within each control type as well as pooled over
all six control runs, because the pooled figure is dominated by the factor of
about 25 between the two types and marks every gap immaterial
(prolet_control_spread_sd_rotation, prolet_control_spread_sd_gaussian). Second,
the robustness reading the specification pre-registered in section 7.2 as "the
same test under control (a)" is now run: the language-against-noise label
permutation test carried out on the rotated-lens shares, once per rotation seed
and once pooled (H16.rotation_control_secondary). Third, an exploratory paired
sign-flip test of each language terminal against its own rotated-lens control
share was added and is labelled exploratory
(H16.lang_above_rotation_control_exploratory). Every value that existed in the
previous verdicts.json is unchanged: a key-by-key comparison of the old and new
files found 93 keys added and 0 values changed or removed, and
per_layer_tables.json and per_layer_shares.csv are byte-identical to their
previous versions. All four verdicts reproduce: H6 NOT SUPPORTED, H16 NOT
SUPPORTED, H16a NOT SUPPORTED, H16b SUPPORTED. Running the script twice in
succession gave byte-identical verdicts.json, per_layer_tables.json and
per_layer_shares.csv, so the added permutation tests are reproducible under the
seed convention the script already used.
